      "units": [
        {
          "id": "cloudfront-primer-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "A customer opens an online store and requests a product photo. With Amazon CloudFront, the request goes to an edge location instead of straight to the store's origin. CloudFront is a content delivery network. It can deliver a copy closer to the customer.",
          "text_sha256": "14c680e23779cbf66c7ecf1e6ac553b2bb540e991ee9fcd755ecc5cb2bbf4000",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "14c680e23779cbf66c7ecf1e6ac553b2bb540e991ee9fcd755ecc5cb2bbf4000",
          "asset_sha256": "fcf5e4aa953fe11625fbf083c3372c65cae51bcbd4c4937cc659cf2d83da17d3"
        },
        {
          "id": "cloudfront-primer-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "On a cache hit, the edge already has a usable copy. It sends the photo back without contacting the origin.",
          "text_sha256": "6ea715fd068d83a0d03bc8a145d893a250bb9e3ef67181c655e10e801ce8ab90",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "6ea715fd068d83a0d03bc8a145d893a250bb9e3ef67181c655e10e801ce8ab90",
          "asset_sha256": "fcf5e4aa953fe11625fbf083c3372c65cae51bcbd4c4937cc659cf2d83da17d3"
        },
        {
          "id": "cloudfront-primer-03",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "On a miss, CloudFront checks upstream and fetches the photo from the S three origin if needed. S three still holds the original.",
          "text_sha256": "79b0558660599dc7fde02db5ca6e95abf88a576374724737316948c46ab377c7",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "a63601840a9d8bbce1eb25a93d2bffa87fa403a67e96f4bdf90d58d6693cf236",
          "asset_sha256": "fcf5e4aa953fe11625fbf083c3372c65cae51bcbd4c4937cc659cf2d83da17d3"
        },
        {
          "id": "cloudfront-primer-04",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "The key decision is simple. Use CloudFront for delivery and caching, and treat access to the origin as a separate decision. That's what the next lesson covers.",
          "text_sha256": "f9ce7c1b2f513407be31b2133d102dca47b147f209fd4888cba7995c818600c8",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "f9ce7c1b2f513407be31b2133d102dca47b147f209fd4888cba7995c818600c8",
          "asset_sha256": "fcf5e4aa953fe11625fbf083c3372c65cae51bcbd4c4937cc659cf2d83da17d3"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
